                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-4">
                        <div class="p-2.5 rounded-3" style="background: var(--adm-sidebar-bg); border: 1px solid var(--adm-card-border);">
                            <div class="fs-5 fw-bold text-success">2.1 sa</div>
                            <small class="small" style="color: var(--adm-text-sub);">Ort. Çözüm Süresi</small>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-4">
                        <div class="p-2.5 rounded-3" style="background: var(--adm-sidebar-bg); border: 1px solid var(--adm-card-border);">
                            <div class="fs-5 fw-bold text-info">4 Açık</div>
                            <small class="small" style="color: var(--adm-text-sub);">İşlemdeki Ticket</small>
